# Build output
/target

# Generated, but committed on purpose: gui/src/main.rs embeds it with
# include_bytes!, so a clone must be able to build without ImageMagick
# installed. install.sh regenerates it from assets/voice-clipper.png when
# magick is available; the committed copy is the fallback.
# Regenerate by hand with:
#   magick -background none assets/voice-clipper.png -resize 64x64 -depth 8 \
#          rgba:gui/assets/icon.rgba

